# Keep the SkyPilot workdir upload small: eval jobs need only the Python source,
# configs, and instruction JSONs. The PyRep/RLBench forks are already installed
# inside the eval image (/opt/src/PyRep2, /opt/src/RLBench2), and datasets and
# checkpoints come from S3 at runtime.
#
# Every directory pattern is anchored with a leading slash. An unanchored `data`
# matches at any depth and silently drops `config/data/`, which Hydra needs to
# compose `data/single` — the eval then dies with MissingConfigException.
/.git
/PyRep
/RLBench
/data
/logs
/train_logs
/eval_logs
/debug_videos
/results
/paper
/plots
/.venv
*.rrd
*.pth
*.zip
*.out
__pycache__
*.egg-info
